  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "看月亮\n\n丽丽：本，我们今晚去看月亮吧！\n本：为什么？\n丽丽：因为今天是中秋节。\n本：中秋节是什么？\n丽丽：中秋节是中国的一个节日。中秋节这天，月亮是最圆最大的。中国人都喜欢在中秋节看月亮，吃月饼。\n本：好吧！但是今晚会下雨。\n丽丽：啊？不会吧……",
    "traditional": "看月亮\n\n麗麗：本，我們今晚去看月亮吧！\n本：為什麼？\n麗麗：因為今天是中秋節。\n本：中秋節是什麼？\n麗麗：中秋節是中國的一個節日。中秋節這天，月亮是最圓最大的。中國人都喜歡在中秋節看月亮，吃月餅。\n本：好吧！但是今晚會下雨。\n麗麗：啊？不會吧……"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Watching the Moon"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本，我们今晚去看月亮吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本，我們今晚去看月亮吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn wǒ men jīn wǎn qù kàn yuè liang ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: Ben, let's go look at the moon tonight!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：为什么？",
      "traditional": "本：為什麼？",
      "pinyin": "běn wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：因为今天是中秋节。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：因為今天是中秋節。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yīn wèi jīn tiān shì zhōng qiū jié",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Li: Because it's Mid-Autumn Festival today."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：中秋节是什么？",
      "traditional": "本：中秋節是什麼？",
      "pinyin": "běn zhōng qiū jié shì shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: What's Mid-Autumn Festival?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：中秋节是中国的一个节日。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：中秋節是中國的一個節日。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zhōng qiū jié shì zhōng guó de yí ge jié rì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "中秋节这天，月亮是最圆最大的。",
      "traditional": "中秋節這天，月亮是最圓最大的。",
      "pinyin": "zhōng qiū jié zhè tiān yuè liang shì zuì yuán zuì dà de",
      "english": "Little Li: Mid-Autumn Festival is one of China's holidays."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "中国人都喜欢在中秋节看月亮，吃月饼。",
      "traditional": "中國人都喜歡在中秋節看月亮，吃月餅。",
      "pinyin": "zhōng guó rén dōu xǐ huan zài zhōng qiū jié kàn yuè liang chī yuè bǐng",
      "english": "The day of the Mid-Autumn Festival is when the moon is its most round and big."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "During Mid-Autumn Festival, Chinese people like to watch the moon and eat moon cakes."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：好吧！但是今晚会下雨。",
      "traditional": "本：好吧！但是今晚會下雨。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo ba dàn shì jīn wǎn huì xià yǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Alright! But it will rain tonight."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "丽丽：啊？不会吧……",
      "traditional": "麗麗：啊？不會吧……",
      "pinyin": "lì lì a bú huì ba",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
